u-boot-spacemit (1.0.5-5) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Read the board product name from the TLV EEPROM in SPL and append
    the board-specific compatible to the device tree handed to U-Boot
    (e.g. "spacemit,k3-pico-itx", "spacemit,k3-com260-ifx" after the
    generic "spacemit,k3"), matching the compatible values used by the
    upstream kernel DTS. Boards that already carry a specific
    compatible (e.g. "deepcomputing,fml13v05") are left untouched.

